{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"5001","title":"Redmi Note 14 Series Expands with More Sand Gold Variants","desc":"Xiaomi Corporation today introduced the expansion of Redmi Note 14 lineup in the refreshing Sand Gold color.","view_cnt":"10285","like_cnt":"3","add_time":"1749027768","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/770_operatorx_operatorx_opx/04/06/2025/1fb9c87c504edfff5e5d94288b9288e2.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eBeijing, China, June 6, 2025 \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e- Xiaomi Corporation (\"Xiaomi\" or the \"Group\"; stock code:1810), a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an Internet of Things (\"IoT\") platform at its core, today introduced the expansion of Redmi Note 14 lineup in the refreshing Sand Gold color. Building on the stylish design and top performance of Redmi Note 14 Series, the Sand Gold variants introduce a new layer of sophistication and elegance to the lineup. First launched with Redmi Note 14 Pro+ 5G during Xiaomi Fan Festival 2025, the Sand Gold variants are now available for Redmi Note 14 Pro 5G, Redmi Note 14 Pro, and Redmi Note 14.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/739_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/04/06/2025/517b255fbef906832334edfcb0a6767e.jpg\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eThe new Sand Gold color adds a touch of sophistication to elevate the bold and functional design that Redmi Note 14 Series is known for. Ready for everyday challenges, each model strikes a balance between robust durability and practical resilience. Redmi Note 14 Pro 5G features an All-Star Armor Structure and Corning® Gorilla® Glass Victus® 2 for enhanced drop and scratch resistance. Redmi Note 14 Pro includes Victus® 2, while Redmi Note 14 is equipped with Corning® Gorilla® Glass 5 — offering solid protection across the lineup. Designed to withstand the elements, water and dust resistance ranges from an IP54 rating on Redmi Note 14,¹ to an IP64 rating on Redmi Note 14 Pro,¹ and an IP68 rating on Redmi Note 14 Pro 5G² — covering a wide variety of everyday environments. Additionally, optimized displays deliver improved responsiveness and touch accuracy, ensuring smooth and precise interaction even in wet or oily conditions.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eBuilding on its all-star durability design, Redmi Note 14 Series goes further with a powerful camera system at its core so users can enjoy a flagship photography experience. Redmi Note 14 Pro models lead with a 200MP pro-grade AI camera system and optical image stabilization (OIS), enabling high-clarity shots with 2x and 4x optical zoom — delivering flagship-level imaging performance that sets a new standard in its price segment. Redmi Note 14, meanwhile, features a 108MP AI camera that captures vibrant colors and sharp details, offering cutting-edge performance at accessible prices. Front cameras have also been upgraded across the lineup to at least 20MP, reaching up to 32MP on Redmi Note 14 Pro. For enhanced creative expression, features like Dynamic shots add subtle movement to every image, while Dual video enables simultaneous recording with both front and rear cameras. Meanwhile, editing is elevated on the Pro models with AI Image Expansion and AI Erase Pro, while Redmi Note 14 includes AI Erase and AI Sky — delivering professional results with ease.³\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eMatching beauty with performance, Redmi Note 14 Series is equipped with powerful chipsets, a robust battery, and charging technology. Redmi Note 14 Pro 5G is powered by the MediaTek Dimensity 7300-Ultra platform, while Redmi Note 14 Pro and Redmi Note 14 run on the MediaTek Helio G100-Ultra and Helio G99-Ultra chipsets, respectively. These octa-core processors offer an exceptionally smooth experience in gaming, streaming, and fast app switching. Paired with large batteries ranging from 5110mAh to 5500mAh,⁴ the series supports all-day use with reliable power.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eIn addition to power and performance, Redmi Note 14 Series features a vibrant 6.67\" display with a smooth refresh rate up to 120Hz, ensuring seamless scrolling, video, and gaming. Redmi Note 14 Pro 5G enhances visuals with a sharp 1.5K resolution, offering up to 3000 nits of peak brightness and delivering a vibrant viewing experience on even the sunniest of days. All models come with TÜV Rheinland Low Blue Light (Hardware Solution), Flicker-Free, and Circadian-Friendly certifications, ensuring a comfortable viewing experience even during extended use.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/819_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/04/06/2025/3f5747ee8a070e4f0628c2592d94463d.jpg\"\u003eIn line with Redmi Note 14 Series' core philosophy of powerful performance, stunning photography, and all-star durability, the new Sand Gold variants expand the lineup with a refined aesthetic, offering a fresh expression of the series' signature experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ePricing and availability⁵\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eRedmi Note 14 Pro 5G Sand Gold is offered in three storage variants.⁶ Suggested retail price starts from 399 USD.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eRedmi Note 14 Pro Sand Gold is offered in two storage variants.⁶ Suggested retail price starts from 299 USD.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eRedmi Note 14 Sand Gold is offered in two storage variants.⁶ Suggested retail price starts from 199 USD\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eProduct images are available here:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/Eq6WApnowpVAiPbMliBiDOQBkBoh4-FksJQLqqF-1t1Sqw?e=qTy3PK\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eRedmi Note 14\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/Eu3I4oD-CZpMu_Fcx_yqesgB0laQmo3DfeNprHvEgjEPMQ?e=9A9ta9\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eRedmi Note 14 Pro\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/EiMF-1o96-VGnqSPhsObuwgB5umG2B0cvOY2cl6AbsG3Iw?e=WrJPK9\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eRedmi Note 14 Pro 5G\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eFor further information on Redmi Note 14 Series, please refer to the global launch press release \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mi.com/global/discover/article?id=4098\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ehere\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eSand Gold Redmi Note 14 Pro 5G, Redmi Note 14 Pro, and Redmi Note 14 Quick Specs\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"131\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eRedmi Note 14 Pro 5G\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eRedmi Note 14 Pro\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eRedmi Note 14\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"131\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eDesign\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eDimensions: 162.33mm x 74.42mm x 8.4mm⁷\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eWeight: 190g⁷\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eIP68 dust and water resistance²\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eDimensions: 162.16mm x 74.92mm x 8.24mm⁷\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eWeight: 180g⁷\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eIP64 dust and splash resistance¹\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eDimensions: 163.25mm x 76.55mm x 8.16mm⁷\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eWeight: 196.5g⁷\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eIP54 dust and splash resistance¹\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"131\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eCamera\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e200MP main camera\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eOIS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ef/1.65\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e2.24μm 16-in-1 pixel binning\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e1/1.4\" sensor size\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e7P lens\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e8MP ultra-wide camera\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ef/2.2\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e2MP macro camera\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ef/2.4\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e20MP front camera\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ef/2.2\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eDynamic shots, Motion tracking focus, Lightning Burst, Dual video\u003c/